---
// StartScreen.astro
---
<div id="start-screen" class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center bg-slate-900 p-4 font-sans fixed inset-0 z-[60]">
  <div class="max-w-md w-full bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 p-8 shadow-2xl text-slate-200">
    <div class="text-center mb-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-black text-white mb-2 tracking-tight">1 Crore Transfer</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm">The scammer is on the phone. They claim to be from the police. They say your son has been arrested, and you must transfer ₹1 Crore immediately to a "Settlement Account" or he goes to jail.</p>
    </div>

    <form id="start-form" class="space-y-6">
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <label class="block text-sm font-bold text-slate-300">Select Pressure Mode:</label>
        
        <label class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 border border-slate-600 bg-slate-700/50 hover:bg-slate-700 cursor-pointer transition-colors group">
          <input type="radio" name="pressure" value="standard" class="mt-1" checked />
          <div>
            <div class="font-bold text-white group-hover:text-blue-400">Standard (3 Minutes)</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">The scammer is impatient. You have exactly 3 minutes of real time to survive the legacy bank interface.</div>
          </div>
        </label>

        <label class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 border border-slate-600 bg-slate-700/50 hover:bg-slate-700 cursor-pointer transition-colors group">
          <input type="radio" name="pressure" value="extended" class="mt-1" />
          <div>
            <div class="font-bold text-white group-hover:text-red-400">Extended (10 Minutes)</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-400">A slow burn. Ideal if you need more time for accessibility reasons, but the pressure will persist.</div>
          </div>
        </label>
      </div>

      <button type="submit" class="w-full bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold py-3 hover:bg-blue-500 transition-colors">
        Connect to Bank
      </button>
    </form>
    
    <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-slate-700 text-xs text-slate-500 text-center">
      Note: This is a simulated environment. No real funds are transferred. The legacy UI is intentionally difficult to use.
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
